title Cassette at other sizes and their own densities (800x480 at 9.2 px/mm, 480x800 at 8.5): recorder, settings, list, trim
sizes 800x480 480x800
env CASSETTE_DEMO recording
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot other-recording
expect esc
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key s
wait 400
shot other-settings
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key l
wait 400
shot other-list
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key t
wait 400
shot other-trim
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
